media: iris: expose explicit Gen2 decode-order output

Qualcomm published HFI_PROP_DECODE_ORDER_OUTPUT 0x0300015b with U32
on the input port. DISPLAY_DELAY_ENABLE=1 and DISPLAY_DELAY=0 select
decode order. Expose that pair only on the SM8550 Gen2 firmware table
used by X1E. Defaults send no new firmware property. Runtime control
changes remain rejected while OUTPUT streams. Propagate property errors
from stream setup rather than reporting success on a rejected command.

This candidate is unqualified on X1E firmware. It must retain the bounds
and removal fixes and be cold activated; never hot unload on a faulted boot.

Protocol sources:
https://patchew.org/linux/1702899149-21321-1-git-send-email-quic._5Fdikshita%40quicinc.com/1702899149-21321-14-git-send-email-quic._5Fdikshita%40quicinc.com/
